      "colour_group": "any",
      "mix_tags": "solo",
      "notes": "Pull them insoles and laces out first and wash those by hand, dig? The shoes go in a mesh delicates bag or a pillowcase, solo — a loose trainer batters that drum and everything else in it, solid.",
